  "title": "Easy Cheesy Hash Browns",
  "description": "This hash brown casserole is made with cream cheese, Cheddar, sour cream, and more. Potatoes bake a creamy sauce for a side or main dish for brunch.",
  "authors": [
    "Crystal"
  ],
